ensibility that values irony and bad taste.","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000367","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000487"],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006000805"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000238"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/camp"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000239","dc:identifier":"homoit0000239","skos:prefLabel":"Cunnilingus","skos:altLabel":["Carpet munching","Cunt licking","Eating pussy","Muff diving"],"rdfs:comment":"A sexual act involving the use of the mouth and tongue to stimulate the clitoris, labia, and vagina.","skos:broader":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000280","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000593","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000969","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001267","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001299"],"skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001487","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001488","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0002578"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/cunnilingus"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000240","dc:identifier":"homoit0000240","skos:prefLabel":"Eunuchs","skos:altLabel":"Castrati","rdfs:comment":"Individuals assigned male at birth who have been castrated. Historically, eunuchs served in royal courts as slaves or servants; in some cases, individuals were castrated before puberty to retain childlike vocal qualities.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000322","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000241","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000632"],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85045580"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/eunuchs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000241","dc:identifier":"homoit0000241","skos:prefLabel":"Castration","rdfs:comment":"Removal of the testes or use of the testes, typically through surgical or chemical means. Includes castration voluntarily undertaken as a gender-affirming surgical procedure or as part of a religious rite. For involuntary castration enacted by legal authorities or as a hate crime, use the term \"Forced castration.\"","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000449","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001060","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001097"],"skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000240","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000302"],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85020752"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000241"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/castration"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000242","dc:identifier":"homoit0000242","skos:prefLabel":"Casual sex","skos:altLabel":"Promiscuity","rdfs:comment":"Intermittent or isolated sexual encounters between two or more people, typically occurring outside of romantic relationships or other forms of commitment,