is twisting","rdfs:comment":"Twisting or squeezing the clitoris to induce sexual pleasure.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000280","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000282","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001267"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003737","dc:identifier":"homoit0003737","skos:prefLabel":"Anti-gender movement","skos:altLabel":"Gender critical movement","rdfs:comment":"A movement that opposes what is referred to as \"gender ideology,\" or the belief that gender is a social construct that exists on a spectrum. Members of the anti-gender movement oppose the visibility, acceptance, and civil and reproductive rights of trans, non-binary, intersex, Two-Spirit, gender diverse, and gender non-conforming people.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001322","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003158","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001819","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001467","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000062","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001893","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001885"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003738","dc:identifier":"homoit0003738","skos:prefLabel":"Sexual fluidity","rdfs:comment":"The idea that a person's sexual orientation can change over time or in different situations.","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001306","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001300","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001315"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003738"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003739","dc:identifier":"homoit0003739","skos:prefLabel":"Uranic people","skos:altLabel":"Androsexual people","rdfs:comment":"People who are attracted to all genders except women, femmes, and feminine-aligned non-binary people, regardless of what gender they were assigned at birth.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000915","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003740","dc:identifier":"homoit0003740","skos:prefLabel":"Neptunic people","skos:altLabel":["Gynesexual people","Gynosexual people"],"rdfs:comment":"People who are attracted to all genders except men, mascs, and masculine-aligned non-binary people, regardless of what gender they were assigned at birth. ","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000915","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003741","dc:identifier":"homoit0003741","skos:prefLabel":"Saturnic people","skos:altLabel":"Skoliosexual people","rdfs:comment":"People who are solely attracted to androgynous non-binary people, rather than monogender-aligned people, regardless of what gender they were assigned at birth.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000915","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003742","dc:identifier":"homoit0003742","skos:prefLabel":"Human trafficking","skos:altLabel":"People trafficking","rdfs:comment":"The trade and exploitation of human beings through force, fraud, and/or coercion, often with the intention of compelling the individual to provide sexual services or other forms of labor against their will.","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003743","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003744"],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006002629"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003742"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003743","dc:identifier":"homoit0003743","skos:prefLabel":"Sex trafficking","skos:altLabel":["Coerced sex work","Forced sex work","Non-consensual sex work","Coerced prostitution","Forced prostitution","Non-consensual prostitution"],"rdfs:comment":"Human trafficking for the purpose of sexual exploitation, including recruiting, holding, moving, defrauding, and/or coercing people into engaging in sexual services and performances they cannot or have not meaningfully consented to.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003742","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006002629"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003742"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003744","dc:identifier":"homoit0003744","skos:prefLabel":["Labor trafficking","Labour trafficking"],"skos:altLabel":["Forced labor","Coerced labor"],"rdfs:comment":"Human trafficking for the purpose of labor exploitation, including recruiting, holding, moving, defrauding, and/or coercing people into labor, such as through debt bondage or involuntary servitude, against their will.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003742","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003742"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003745","dc:identifier":"homoit0003745","skos:prefLabel":"LGBTQ+ victims of human trafficking","skos:altLabel":["Victims of human trafficking (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ trafficking victims","Trafficking victims (LGBTQ)"],"rdfs:comment":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced and may or may not have survived human trafficking. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000312","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003746","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003750","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003754"],"skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003747","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"http