fficking victims (LGBTQ)"],"rdfs:comment":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced and may or may not have survived labor trafficking. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003745","skos:narrower":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003755","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003756","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003755","dc:identifier":"homoit0003755","skos:prefLabel":["LGBTQ+ survivors of labor trafficking","LGBTQ+ survivors of labour trafficking"],"skos:altLabel":["Survivors of labor trafficking (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ labor trafficking survivors","Labor trafficking survivors (LGBTQ)"],"rdfs:comment":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced and survived labor trafficking. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003754","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003757","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003756","dc:identifier":"homoit0003756","skos:prefLabel":["Two-Spirit victims of labor trafficking","Two-Spirit victims of labour trafficking"],"skos:altLabel":["Two Spirit victims of labor trafficking","Two-Spirited victims of labor trafficking","Two Spirited victims of labor trafficking","2S victims of labor trafficking","Two-Spirit labor trafficking victims"],"rdfs:comment":"Two-Spirit people who have experienced and may or may not have survived labor trafficking. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003747","skos:narrower":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003757","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003754","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003757","dc:identifier":"homoit0003757","skos:prefLabel":["Two-Spirit survivors of labor trafficking","Two-Spirit survivors of labour trafficking"],"skos:altLabel":["Two Spirit survivors of labor trafficking","Two-Spirited survivors of labor trafficking","Two Spirited survivors of labor trafficking","2S survivors of labor trafficking","Two-Spirit labor trafficking survivors"],"rdfs:comment":"Two-Spirit people who have experienced and survived labor trafficking. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003756","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003755","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003759","dc:identifier":"homoit0003759","skos:prefLabel":"Intersex sex workers","skos:altLabel":["Intersex prostitutes","Intersex prostitution"],"rdfs:comment":"Intersex people who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe intersex people working across the broad spectrum of sex work.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003760","dc:identifier":"homoit0003760","skos:prefLabel":"Non-binary sex workers","skos:altLabel":["Nonbinary sex workers","Non-binary prostitutes","Nonbinary prostitutes","Non-binary prostitution","Nonbinary prostitution"],"rdfs:comment":"Non-binary people who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe non-binary people working across the broad spectrum of sex work.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003761","dc:identifier":"homoit0003761","skos:prefLabel":"Two-Spirit sex workers","skos:altLabel":["Two Spirit sex workers","Two-Spirited sex workers","Two Spirited sex workers","2S sex workers","Two-Spirit prostitutes","Two Spirit prostitutes","Two-Spirited prostitutes","Two Spirited prostitutes","2S prostitutes","Two-Spirit prostitution"],"rdfs:comment":"Two-Spirit people who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe Two-Spirit people working across the broad spectrum of sex work.","skos:broader":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001480","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003758"],"skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003762","dc:identifier":"homoit0003762","skos:prefLabel":"Māhū sex workers","skos:altLabel":["Mahu sex workers","Māhū prostitutes","Mahu prostitutes","Māhū prostitution","Mahu prostitution","Māhū sex work","Mahu sex work"],"rdfs:comment":"Māhū who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe Māhū working across the broad spectrum of sex work.","skos:broader":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000979","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003758"],"skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003763","dc:identifier":"homoit0003763","skos:prefLabel":"Phone sex work","skos:altLabel":"Telephone sex work","rdfs:comment":"Real-time sex work via phone calls, text messaging, or online voice calls. Use \"Cam modeling\" for real-time sex work via online video calls and livestreams.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001111","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003764","dc:identifier":"homoit0003764","skos:prefLabel":"Stripping","skos:altLabel":["Pole dancing","Pole-dancing","Peeling","Stripteasing","Exotic dancing"],"rdfs:comment":"A form of sex work that involves undressing to music while using a pole to perform dance moves, whether in a venue like a strip club or by hire at private parties. Stripping may also be performed by amateurs in private settings.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001343","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006006232"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003765","dc:identifier":"homoit0003765","skos:prefLabel":"Anti-sex work feminism","skos:altLabel":["Anti sex work feminism","Anti-sex-work feminism"],"rdfs:comment":"A form of feminism that alleges that sex work is inherently coercive and exploitative. Although not all sex workers are women and not all clients are men, anti-sex work feminism largely centers this gender dynamic, viewing sex work as a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000437","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003766","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003766","dc:identifier":"homoit0003766","skos:prefLabel":"SWERFs","skos:altLabel":["Sex work exclusionary radical feminists","Sex worker exclusionary radical feminists"],"rdfs:comment":"An acronym for \"sex work-exclusionary radical feminists,\" this term refers to people who subscribe to a subset of radical feminism that rejects sex worker rights and solidarity with sex workers under the belief that sex work is antithetical to their ideology and inherently perpetuates oppression against women.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003177","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003767","dc:identifier":"homoit0003767","skos:prefLabel":"Anti-pornography feminism","skos:altLabel":["Anti-porn feminism","Anti pornography feminism","Anti porn feminism"],"rdfs:comment":"A form of feminism that alleges that pornography is a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy and is thus inherently violent and exploitative.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000437","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003768","dc:identifier":"homoit0003768","skos:prefLabel":"Cam modeling","skos:altLabel":["Camming","Webcam modeling"],"rdfs:comment":"Short for \"webcam modeling,\" this term refers to real-time sex work via online video calls and livestreams.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003769","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003769","dc:identifier":"homoit0003769","skos:prefLabel":"Cam models","skos:altLabel":["Webcam models","Cammodels"],"rdfs:comment":"Short for \"webcam models,\" this term refers to sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. ","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003758","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003770","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003771"],"skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003768","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2022006806"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003770","dc:identifier":"homoit0003770","skos:prefLabel":"Camboys","skos:altLabel":["Cam boys","Webcam boys"],"rdfs:comment":"Short for \"webcam boys,\" this term refers to men sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. Use only for individuals who self-identify as camboys; otherwise, use \"Cam models.\"","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003769","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003771","dc:identifier":"homoit0003771","skos:prefLabel":"Camgirls","skos:altLabel":["Cam girls","Webcam girls"],"rdfs:comment":"Short for \"webcam girls,\" this term refers to women sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. Use only for individuals who self-identify as camgirls; otherwise, use \"Cam models.\"","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003769","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003772","dc:identifier":"homoit0003772","skos:prefLabel":"Sex work legislation","skos:altLabel":["Sex work laws","Prostitution legislation","Prostitution laws"],"rdfs:comment":"Laws and regulations addressing the practice, solitiation, and/or facilitation of sex work, including its legality. Legislation may variously address the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000702","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776"],"skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774"],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2013003427"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003773","dc:identifier":"homoit0003773","skos:prefLabel":["Criminalization of sex work","Criminalisation of sex work"],"skos:altLabel":["Sex work criminalization","Criminalization of prostitution","Prostitution criminalization"],"rdfs:comment":"The process by which the practice and solicitation of sex work is made criminal, typically by introducing laws, regulations, and criminal penalties. Efforts to criminalize sex work often target street sex work and other forms of \"direct,\" visible sex work.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000314","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003774","dc:identifier":"homoit0003774","skos:prefLabel":["Decriminalization of sex work","Decriminalisation of sex work"],"skos:altLabel":["Sex work decriminalization","Decriminalization of prostitution","Prostitution decriminalization"],"rdfs:comment":"The process of lessening or removing laws, regulations, and/or criminal penalties targeting the practice, solicitation, and/or facilitation of sex work. Decriminalization efforts may variously address the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000339","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003775","dc:identifier":"homoit0003775","skos:prefLabel":["Legalization of sex work","Legalisation of sex work"],"skos:altLabel":["Sex work legalization","Legalization of prostitution","Prostitution legalization"],"rdfs:comment":"The creation of a set of laws and regulations intended to legalize the practice and solicitation of sex work, particularly street sex work and other forms of \"direct,\" visible sex work, within certain parameters. This may variously include legalizing the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers. Individuals operating outside of these laws and regulations remain subject to penalties.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003776","dc:identifier":"homoit0003776","skos:prefLabel":"Nordic model (Sex work)","skos:altLabel":["End demand (Sex work)","Equality model (Sex work)","Neo-abolition movement (Sex work)","Nordic and Swedish model (Sex work)","Swedish model (Sex work)"],"rdfs:comment":"A legislative approach to sex work first instituted in Sweden in 1999 and then in Norway in 2009 that centers on the criminalization of clients, third parties, and many of the ways sex workers operate. The Nordic model is a form of sex work abolition predicated on the idea that no person can consent to engage in commercial sexual services and that sex workers must therefore be educated and reformed. Sex workers and activists have heavily criticized and opposed the Nordic model.","skos:broader":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003772","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003777"],"skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003777","dc:identifier":"homoit0003777","skos:prefLabel":"Sex work abolition","skos:altLabel":["Abolition movement (Sex work)","Sex work abolitionism","Sex work abolition movement"],"rdfs:comment":"A movement to abolish sex work through a variety of different means, including supporting \"end demand\" laws, the Nordic model, or the broader criminalization of sex work; organizing and speaking vocally against sex work as inherently exploitative; and rejecting efforts to recognize sex work as labor.","skos:narrower":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003776","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003773","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003774","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003765","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003775"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003777"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003778","dc:identifier":"homoit0003778","skos:prefLabel":["Curb crawling","Kerb crawling"],"rdfs:comment":"The practice of driving or idling in one's car around areas known for street sex work in order to solicit sex workers.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003779","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000278","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003779"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003779","dc:identifier":"homoit0003779","skos:prefLabel":"Solicitation of sex work","skos:altLabel":"Soliciting","rdfs:comment":"The act of offering or attempting to exchange money or goods for sexual services or performances.","skos:narrower":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003778","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000278","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003779"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003780","dc:identifier":"homoit0003780","skos:prefLabel":"Street sex work","skos:altLabel":"Street prostitution","rdfs:comment":"Sex work that is generally solicited in a public place such as a street, street corner, or park.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85107626"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003781","dc:identifier":"homoit0003781","skos:prefLabel":"Survival sex work","skos:altLabel":"Survival prostitution","rdfs:comment":"A form of sex work performed in lieu of other employment or in order to meet immediate needs, such as shelter, food, clothing, familial care, etc. Use only for sex work that is self-described as survival.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003782","dc:identifier":"homoit0003782","skos:prefLabel":"Third parties (Sex work)","rdfs:comment":"A legal term for individuals who supervise, coordinate, assist, or facilitate sex work, either on behalf of sex workers or their clients. Third parties include managers, brothel-keepers, concierges, drivers etc.","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003783","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003784","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003785"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003783","dc:identifier":"homoit0003783","skos:prefLabel":"Madams (Sex work)","skos:altLabel":"Procuresses","rdfs:comment":"People who mediate between sex workers and clients. This term has historically been used to describe women but can be used for individuals of any gender based on their preference. Follow the individual's preference for \"Madams,\" \"Pimps,\" or \"Sex work concierges\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003782","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85107177"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003784","dc:identifier":"homoit0003784","skos:prefLabel":"Pimps","skos:altLabel":"Procurers","rdfs:comment":"People who mediate between sex workers and clients. Since the 20th century, this term has been used as a derogatory way of describing urban, working-class Black American men, regardless of their involvement in the facilitation of sex work. While some Black Americans--including women--have embraced an evolved version of the word \"pimp,\" often stripped of its association with sex work facilitation, it still carries racist and classist connotations and should be used with caution. Follow the individual's preference for \"Pimps,\" \"Madams,\" or \"Sex work concierges\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003782","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85102185"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003785","dc:identifier":"homoit0003785","skos:prefLabel":"Sex work concierges","rdfs:comment":"People who mediate between sex workers and clients. Follow the individual's preference for \"Sex work concierges,\" \"Pimps,\" or \"Madams\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003782","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003786","dc:identifier":"homoit0003786","skos:prefLabel":"Anti-sex worker discrimination","skos:altLabel":["Discrimination against sex workers","Anti sex worker discrimination","Anti-prostitute discrimination","Anti prostitute discrimination","Discrimination against prostitutes"],"rdfs:comment":"The unjust or prejudicial treatment of sex workers due to their work or identity as a sex worker; may include the denial of legal rights, employment, and housing.","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003787","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003788"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003786"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003787","dc:identifier":"homoit0003787","skos:prefLabel":"Anti-sex worker violence","skos:altLabel":["Violence against sex workers","Anti sex worker violence","Anti-prostitute violence","Anti prostitute violence","Violence against prostitutes"],"rdfs:comment":"Behavior involving physical force intended to harm or kill sex workers on the basis of their work or identity as a sex worker.","skos:narrower":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003788","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000109","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003787"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003788","dc:identifier":"homoit0003788","skos:prefLabel":"Murder of sex workers","skos:altLabel":"Murder of prostitutes","rdfs:comment":"Intentional killing of sex workers on the basis of their work or identity as a sex worker.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003787","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000109","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003786"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003787"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003789","dc:identifier":"homoit0003789","skos:prefLabel":"Harm reduction (Sex work)","rdfs:comment":"A set of practical strategies and ideas aimed at reducing the negative impacts of sex work on sex workers, as well as a social justice movement advocating for the rights of sex workers.","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003790","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003791"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003789"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790","dc:identifier":"homoit0003790","skos:prefLabel":"Sex worker rights","skos:altLabel":["Sex workers' rights","Rights of sex workers","Prostitute rights","Prostitutes' rights","Rights of prostitutes"],"rdfs:comment":"Legal, social, or ethical principles of freedom or entitlement held by or pursued by sex workers. This includes, but is not limited to, human rights, health rights, freedom from discrimination and prejudice, and labor rights.","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003789","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003791"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003790"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003791","dc:identifier":"homoit0003791","skos:prefLabel":"Sex work activism","skos:altLabel":"Prostitution activism","rdfs:comment":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for sex workers.","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003790","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003789"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003791"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003792","dc:identifier":"homoit0003792","skos:prefLabel":"Sugaring","skos:altLabel":["Sugar dating","Girlfriend experience","Boyfriend experience"],"rdfs:comment":"A form of sex work in which companionship and sexual services are exchanged for money, gifts, and other material benefits. Generally but not always sugaring describes a relationship between an older client and a younger sex worker.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001276","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003793","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003794","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003795"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003793","dc:identifier":"homoit0003793","skos:prefLabel":"Sugar babies","rdfs:comment":"People who provide companionship and sexual services to sugar mamas or daddies in exchange for money, gifts, and other material benefits.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003758","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003792","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003794","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003795"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003794","dc:identifier":"homoit0003794","skos:prefLabel":"Sugar daddies","rdfs:comment":"People who provide money, gifts, and other material benefits to sugar babies in exchange for companionship and sexual services. Follow the individual's preference for \"Sugar daddies\" or \"Sugar mamas\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000278","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003793","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003792"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000278"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003795","dc:identifier":"homoit0003795","skos:prefLabel":"Sugar mamas","skos:altLabel":["Sugar mommas","Sugar mommies"],"rdfs:comment":"People who provide money, gifts, and other material benefits to sugar babies in exchange for companionship and sexual services. Follow the individual's preference for \"Sugar mamas\" or \"Sugar daddies\" whenever possible.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000278","skos:related":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003793","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003792"],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000278"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003796","dc:identifier":"homoit0003796","skos:prefLabel":"Erotic massage businesses","skos:altLabel":["Sexual massage parlors","Rub and tug massage parlors","Full service massage parlors","Erotic massage parlors"],"rdfs:comment":"Massage businesses that provide sexual services, either legally or under the table.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000011","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000402","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95008240"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003797","dc:identifier":"homoit0003797","skos:prefLabel":"LGBTQ+ strippers","skos:altLabel":["Strippers (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ stripteasers","Stripteasers (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ pole dancers","Pole dancers (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ peelers","Peelers (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ exotic dancers","Exotic dancers (LGBTQ)"],"rdfs:comment":"LGBTQ+ sex workers who undress to music while using a pole to perform dance moves, whether in a venue like a strip club or by hire at private parties. For stripping performed by amateurs in private settings, use \"Stripping.\"","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003798","dc:identifier":"homoit0003798","skos:prefLabel":"LGBTQ+ porn stars","skos:altLabel":["LGBTQ+ pornstars","LGBTQ+ porn actors","LGBTQ+ porn actresses","Porn stars (LGBTQ)","Pornstars (LGBTQ)","Porn actors (LGBTQ)","Porn actresses (LGBTQ)","LGBTQ+ adult entertainers","Adult entertainers (LGBTQ)"],"rdfs:comment":"LGBTQ+ actors in erotic or sexually explicit films.","skos:broader":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001127","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000008","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001277"],"skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000013","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003799","dc:identifier":"homoit0003799","skos:prefLabel":"Red light districts","skos:altLabel":["Red-light districts","Pleasure disticts"],"rdfs:comment":"Areas designated (often but not always legally) for the practice and solicitation of sex work.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000011","skos:narrower":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003800","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008005691"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003800","dc:identifier":"homoit0003800","skos:prefLabel":"Sex drive-ins","skos:altLabel":"Sex boxes","rdfs:comment":"Partitioned car garages found in a few countries in Europe that are designed to allow and facilitate sex work in cars. Sex drive-ins are often created by local authorities to help regulate where sex work occurs.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003799","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003801","dc:identifier":"homoit0003801","skos:prefLabel":["Sex workers of color","Sex workers of colour"],"skos:altLabel":["People of color sex workers","Racialized sex workers","Non-white sex workers"],"rdfs:comment":"Sex workers who are not white and self-identify as people of color.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003758","skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001101","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003802","dc:identifier":"homoit0003802","skos:prefLabel":"LGBTQ+ pornography","skos:altLabel":["Pornography (LGBTQ)","Porn (LGBTQ)"],"rdfs:comment":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring LGBTQ+ performers and/or made for LGBTQ+ people.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001128","skos:narrower":["https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000013","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000923","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003803","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003804","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003805","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003806","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003807","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003808","https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003809"],"skos:related":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003810","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003803","dc:identifier":"homoit0003803","skos:prefLabel":"Lesbian pornography","rdfs:comment":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring lesbian performers and/or made for lesbians.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003802","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2019103063"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003804","dc:identifier":"homoit0003804","skos:prefLabel":"Gay pornography","rdfs:comment":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring gay performers and/or made for gay men.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003802","skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2011000434"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-02-23"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 3.7.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003805","dc:identifier":"homoit0003805","skos:prefLabel":"Bisexual pornography","rdfs:comment":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring bisexual performers and/or made for bisexual people.","skos:broader":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0003802","skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type"